{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18719","headline":"读书 · 柳宗元","name":"读书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽沈谢世事，俛默窥唐虞。\n上下观古今，起伏千万途。\n遇欣或自笑，感戚亦以吁。\n缥帙各舒散，前後互相逾。\n瘴痾扰灵府，日与往昔殊。\n临文乍了了，彻卷兀若无。\n竟夕谁与言，但与竹素俱。\n倦极便倒卧，熟寐乃一苏。\n欠伸展肢体，吟咏心自愉。\n得意适其适，非愿爲世儒。\n道尽即闭口，萧散捐囚拘。\n巧者爲我拙，智者爲我愚。\n书史足自悦，安用勤与劬。\n贵尔六尺躯，勿爲名所驱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}